Output demo.gif

Set Shell zsh
Set FontSize 16
Set Width 1600
Set Height 900
Set Theme "Builtin Solarized Dark"
Set Padding 20
Set WindowBar Colorful

# Open zellij
Sleep 1s
Type "zellij"
Sleep 2s
Enter

# Trigger plugin
Sleep 2s
Ctrl+t
Type "n"
Sleep 2s

# Enter new tab name
Type "my-project-folder"
Sleep 2s
Enter
Sleep 5s


